//  BRAIN BITES — topic registry
//
//  Two data formats are supported:
//   1. `items: [["apple", 40, ["apples"]], ...]`  explicit frequency (data.js, packs.js)
//   2. `pool: "apple, banana, orange, ..."`       ranked — most obvious first
//
