//  position, spread log-uniformly from ~38% down to ~0.1%. So ordering is
//  the only authoring decision: put what everyone says first, and the
//  things only you would think of last.
//
//  `wiki` lists keywords used to validate answers that AREN'T in the pool
//  against live Wikipedia. Keep them broad — the point is wide acceptance.
// ============================================================

